# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-mineb00-0 = 
    矮人用那双细小的珠眼望着你，忽地咧嘴一笑，露出几颗变色的牙齿。他开口说道。<br><p>         Gabriel fumblejig,<br>          All of the riches that<br>          Miners once dug from here<br>          Now will be mine.<br>          You must abandon my<br>          Mine now forever.<br>          $NamedOneName shall own all of it<br>          Isn't that fine?<br><p>
    你...<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>试图寻求妥协。<br><p><opt>...<indent>威胁 $NamedOneName。<br><p><opt>...<indent>献上十五种药剂，以求和平。<br><p><opt>...<indent>从他身旁擦肩而过，深入矿井。<br><opt>x<br><opt>x
msg-mineb00-1 = 
    $ChosenOneName娓娓道来：“没收矿工隧道实属不公。此矿乃他们辛勤劳作所成，理应分享其利。”矮人摇晃蓬乱头颅，吟唱道：<br><p>         Hickamore, hackamore,<br>          Foolish intruders, you<br>          Think for the miners that<br>          I care one bean?<br>          If you want me to go<br>          Back to my underworld<br>          You must give up to me<br>          Potions fifteen.
msg-mineb00-2 = 
    为$NamedOneName的回应所扰，$ChosenOneName问道：“究竟要我们给你什么，才能停止这场争斗？”<br><p>
    矮人答道，<br><p>         Opera Arepo,<br>          Give me some potions that<br>          All are quite different.<br>          I need fifteen!<br><p>
    你沉吟良久。十五种药剂！或许与其纳贡，不如武力驱逐矿工。
msg-mineb00-3 = 
    愤怒地，$NamedOneName 喊道，<br><p>         Grumbling and rumbling so,<br>          Greedy humanity,<br>          Vulnerability<br>          Is what I see.<br>          I have the choice to use<br>          All sorts of weapons and<br>          Soon you will go down to<br>          Hell, or you'll flee.<br><p>
    蜷缩的身影从阴影中浮现。你已将矮人逼至绝境。你拔出武器，他戴上一顶红帽，瞬间消失。他的爪牙冲上前，发动攻击！
msg-mineb00-4 = 
    怒视着$NamedOneName，$ChosenOneName说你将杀死任何试图偷矿的矮人。他似乎颇为钦佩，并对你百般奉承。<br><p>         Terrors and threatenings!<br>          Woebegone hapless me,<br>          You are so terrible,<br>          Please leave me be!<br>          If you will take from me<br>          This gift of quality<br>          Then you beholden will<br>          be, friends with me.<br><p>
    矮人王取出一件华丽的钢制胸甲，向你递来。这是贿赂，只为让你离开矿坑！你是否……<br><opt><br><opt><br><opt><br><opt><br><p><p><opt>...<indent>接受吗？<br><p><opt>...<indent>还是拒绝？
msg-mineb00-5 = 
    怒视$NamedOneName，$ChosenOneName警告他，凡胆敢窃取矿工财物的矮人，必遭诛杀。$NamedOneName冷笑一声：<br><p>         You are not numerous<br>          Why should I fear that you<br>          So few in number could<br>          Hurt me at all?
msg-mineb00-6 = 
    怒视$NamedOneName，$ChosenOneName警告他，凡胆敢窃取矿工财物的矮人，必遭诛杀。$NamedOneName冷笑一声：<br><p>         What will you do to me?<br>          You are not warriors bold<br>          I do not think you could<br>          soon conquer me.
msg-mineb00-7 = 
    当汝交付药剂时，$NamedOneName 越发兴奋，几至手舞足蹈。药剂尽数交毕，他欣喜若狂，<br><p>         Fol-de-rol, Lol-de-rol,<br>          Ho! I own all of them!<br>          All of the potions made<br>          Under the sun!<br>          Now I take them with me,<br>          Down to my lair beneath!<br>          There I shall study them,<br>          Glorious fun!<br><p>
    矮人将一顶红帽扣于头上，携药剂遁去。
msg-mineb00-8 = 
    你在矿井里四处探查一番，确信矮人及其族人已然离去，再无半点踪迹。连他们的陷阱也已被尽数拆除。矿井重开，生意又可兴隆！<br><p>
    你离开矿井，重返矿工营地。走出矮人王域那股沉闷的气息，重归人间，顿觉身心一爽。矿工们纷纷迎上前来，显然盼着你此行得偿所愿。与冷酷寡情、举手投足皆有算计的矮人不同，此刻能与人类坦诚相待，实乃快事。
msg-mineb00-9 = 
    当你前行，$NamedOneName双目怒焰喷薄，旋即戴上红帽，身影倏忽不见。他已隐身！
msg-mineb00-10 = 
    目光温柔地注视着那华丽的胸甲，$ChosenOneName从$NamedOneName手中接过它。$NamedOneName激动得难以自持，雀跃不已。他高声喊道，<br><p>         You took the gift from me!<br>          Freely and willingly!<br>          Now I can tell you, "Go!,<br>          Do not return!"<br><p>
    你们面面相觑，惊愕不已。接受这份礼物，已使你们落入矮人的掌控！不由自主地，你们悄然转身，走出矿井。出得门外，再欲入内，却已无法进入。矮人之术果然灵验。<br><p>
    至少汝仍保有胸甲。
